      <span class="story-piece">✨ NEW POINT · Notice how we give a reason: <b>비 때문에</b> (because of the rain) is the plain everyday cause, <b>폭우로 인해</b> (due to the downpour) is the formal written cause, and <b>비가 많이 와서 그런지</b> (maybe because it rained so much) is a guess about a cause — three ways to answer "왜?" (why)!</span>
